    id: "missing-children", name: "the five children", aliases: ["the five", "the missing children"], nameStatus: "descriptor", group: "victim",
    summary: "The five children whom FNaF1's newspaper clippings link to one incident at Freddy Fazbear's Pizza. Two local children were reported lured into a back room there on the night of a June 26th, by a man whom police think dressed as a company mascot [[fnaf1-news-kids-vanish]] [[fnaf1-news-dressed-as-mascot]]. Another clipping says that five children are now linked to the incident [[fnaf1-news-five-children]]. A man was identified on video, caught the next morning and charged, and no bodies were found [[fnaf1-news-suspect-captured]] [[fnaf1-news-charged-vs-convicted]]. Another clipping has the restaurant threatened again with closure over a foul odour from the mascots, and says that police were called when parents noticed what looked like blood and mucus round the mascots' eyes and mouths [[fnaf1-news-sanitation]]. The game shows the clippings at random and gives them no order. In a FNaF2 minigame the Puppet gives four grey, dead-looking children the heads of Freddy, Bonnie, Chica and Foxy [[fnaf2-give-gifts-give-life]], and in FNaF3 five crying grey child figures corner the purple man [[fnaf3-n5-ghosts-safe-room]].",
    status: "Two children were reported lured on the night of <<a June 26 between 1980 and 1986|estimated|fnaf1-news-kids-vanish,fnaf1-news-uphill-battle,fnaf2-call1-new-location,fnaf2-overtime-robots-scrapped,secret-of-the-mimic-rnd-proto-pizzeria|June 26th is printed in a clipping with no year, for the night two children were lured. The records alone put it before the restaurant that opened in 1987. The model ends the bracket in 1986, because the old restaurant traded on after the incident and was then left to rot for quite a while: that last step is made by the model and is not a printed limit. On the night Secret of the Mimic is set, in 1979, prototypes that the files of that game label as the four mascots are still unfinished, so the earliest June is that of 1980, and that end of the bracket is soft.>>; five were later linked to the incident, and no bodies were found. Four of them most likely stay on in Freddy, Bonnie, Chica and Foxy until the purple man takes those machines apart. Where the five are after that is not shown.",
