    summary: "The child whom the Puppet is set to guard in Pizzeria Simulator's Security Puppet game, marked by a green bracelet [[ffps-security-puppet-assignment]]. On the fourth play a second box sits on the Puppet's box while the child is outside in the rain, at the window [[ffps-security-puppet-trapped]]. Once free, the Puppet goes out, finds the child's body and collapses beside it [[ffps-security-puppet-dead-child]]. The same game is on the terminal while the Cassette Man speaks of the day his daughter was shut out [[ffps-completion-security-puppet-terminal]].",
