    summary: "A dark purple version of the slumped yellow bear, with glowing white eyes and teeth, seen in FNaF2 and FNaF3. In FNaF2 it sits, rarely, against the wall of Parts and Service, where the older Bonnie normally sits [[fnaf2-shadow-freddy]]. In FNaF3's minigames a dark purple bear says \"follow me.\" and leads Freddy, Bonnie, Chica and Foxy in turn to the place where the purple figure takes each apart [[fnaf3-eon-shadow-freddy-follow-me]] [[fnaf3-eon-purple-guy-dismantles]]. Neither game shows a name for it.",
