    summary: "A red figure fishing at a lake in the deepest hidden tunnel of FNaF World. He tells the player \"My name is Old Man Consequences. Come have a seat, and let's fish for a while.\" [[fw-old-man-consequences]] In Ultimate Custom Night, with only him active, catching a fish brings the player to the same lake, where he says \"Leave the demon to his demons. Rest your own soul. There is nothing else.\" [[ucn-omc-ending]] After that the player can only sink into the lake, and the game closes [[ucn-omc-ending-drowning]].",
